  "description": "A .NET library that turns a Rust crate into native binaries and a .NET 10 wrapper class library. It clones the crate from a Git repository with CodeBrix.LibGit2 (or takes a local Cargo.toml), checks first that the machine can build and returns install guidance when it cannot, builds the crate for the chosen runtime identifiers with the installed Rust toolchain or inside a Docker container, optionally links it to the CodeBrix WebGPU engine, generates a C facade for plain Rust libraries from their public API, and writes a .NET 10 wrapper class library (optionally packable as a NuGet package) around the result, together with a JSON build record.",
